Kamala Harris, will be allowed to cast the

00:00:27.949 --> 00:00:36.230
deciding vote in practical terms, giving Democrats
control of the Senate.

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:43.719
What they will be able to get done, of course,
will depend on maintaining all 50 Democratic

00:00:43.719 --> 00:00:45.239
senators united.

00:00:45.239 --> 00:00:51.640
And it's almost cliche at this point to say,
but much of that will come down to does Joe

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:57.000
Manchin, the most conservative of the Democrats
in the Senate from West Virginia.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:03.449
Does Joe Manchin want to do many of the things
that Joe Biden outlined in his presidential

00:01:03.449 --> 00:01:05.119
platform?

00:01:05.119 --> 00:01:09.250
Or will Joe Manchin be the thorn in the side
of the Democrats?

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:12.840
