who in some cases may not want to go with

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:14.289
the Biden idea.

00:01:14.289 --> 00:01:17.280
There are, at least theoretically, some Republicans
who might.

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:23.240
You know, the prototypical example is that
the constituents for Republican Maine Senator

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:30.950
Susan Collins may be more to the left of the
constituents for Democratic senator in West

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:32.729
Virginia, Joe Manchin.

00:01:32.729 --> 00:01:37.599
And these are more detailed level discussions
that we will have in the future.

00:01:37.599 --> 00:01:45.749
But what we do know is that in terms of the
Kelly Lefler incumbent versus challenger Raphael

00:01:45.749 --> 00:01:51.340
